sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as AI assistant
    participant Metrics as Metrics tool
    participant Errors as Error tool

    Agent->>Metrics: Read checkout metrics
    Metrics-->>Agent: Request counts and error counts
    Note over Agent: Calculate the error rate<br/>and choose the next operation
    Agent->>Errors: Read checkout errors
    Errors-->>Agent: Error records
    Note over Agent: Select evidence for the answer
